00:11:19,433 --> 00:11:20,966
Her file is on your computer.

288
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,200
Then two minutes.

289
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,200
In this world of yours,

290
00:11:25,201 --> 00:11:27,000
you find people by compressing time?

291
00:11:27,233 --> 00:11:28,233
Mr. Xu.

292
00:11:28,234 --> 00:11:30,633
Respect the characters. Thank you.

293
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:33,700
Did I say you could leave?

294
00:11:35,633 --> 00:11:36,699
Chief Gu.

295
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:38,033
I was just going to

296
00:11:38,066 --> 00:11:39,333
make you another cup of coffee.

297
00:11:40,633 --> 00:11:41,833
Making coffee.

298
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:52,533
Affection Points.

299
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:54,932
Add twenty.

300
00:11:54,933 --> 00:11:55,933
No need.

301
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,200
Sorry.

302
00:12:02,900 --> 00:12:03,900
Sorry.

303
00:12:04,533 --> 00:12:06,466
This is the office, Chief Gu.

304
00:12:08,333 --> 00:12:09,333
So?

305
00:12:09,733 --> 00:12:11,233
We have cameras here.

306
00:12:11,266 --> 00:12:13,200
If you get caught on camera,

307
00:12:13,233 --> 00:12:15,066
a fine is unavoidable.

308
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:21,099
Please stay out of the leads' romantic highlights.

309
00:12:21,100 --> 00:12:22,166
Xu Zhou,

310
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:23,732
step back three meters

311
00:12:23,733 --> 00:12:26,732
to leave room for the accidental kiss.

312
00:12:26,733 --> 00:12:28,366
What room?

313
00:12:34,133 --> 00:12:36,833
Kiss. Failed.

314
00:12:38,133 --> 00:12:39,066
When a person falls,

315
00:12:39,100 --> 00:12:40,766
normally, shouldn't you catch them first?

316
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,400
Why would it be a kiss?

317
00:12:45,633 --> 00:12:46,533
In a Sweet Romance World,

318
00:12:46,534 --> 00:12:48,566
trust the direction the protagonist falls in.

319
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:50,600
Are you done, Lin Yu'an?

320
00:12:51,133 --> 00:12:52,733
You don't need to return to your desk.

321
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,600
On what grounds?

322
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:56,466
The grounds?

323
00:12:57,533 --> 00:12:59,366
The Chengnan project floor price leaked.

324
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:01,099
Last night at 10:23.

325
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:03,033
You entered my office alone.

326
00:13:03,066 --> 00:13:04,132
At 10:41.

327
00:13:04,133 --> 00:13:05,732
The rival company received the quotation.

328
00:13:05,733 --> 00:13:06,866
At 11:00 sharp.

329
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:09,833
You met with their lead alone.

330
00:13:10,666 --> 00:13:12,500
This morning my mother told me

331
00:13:12,666 --> 00:13:14,400
you also took five million from her.

332
00:13:16,033 --> 00:13:19,633
Office, person, money, all yours.

333
00:13:19,833 --> 00:13:20,833
Lin Yu'an,

334
00:13:21,033 --> 00:13:23,499
do you still plan to make me find more coincidences?

335
00:13:23,500 --> 00:13:25,400
Wait, Chief Gu.

336
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:26,533
I think I...

337
00:13:26,533 --> 00:13:27,533
Warning.

338
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:29,733
The key misunderstanding hasn't been set up yet.

339
00:13:30,033 --> 00:13:31,632
Supporting role muted thirty seconds.

340
00:13:31,633 --> 00:13:32,900
Don't disturb me.

341
00:13:33,433 --> 00:13:34,500
I think I have it here.

342
00:13:41,466 --> 00:13:42,600
I went into the office.

343
00:13:42,866 --> 00:13:43,866
I met the person too.

344
00:13:43,867 --> 00:13:46,266
I took that five million too.

345
00:13:46,633 --> 00:13:48,900
Good, very good.

346
00:13:49,633 --> 00:13:50,966
Since you've admitted it all.

347
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,200
Then I won't spare your dignity.

348
00:13:53,733 --> 00:13:54,833
Lin Yu'an.

349
00:13:54,866 --> 00:13:56,133
You're fired.

350
00:13:57,266 --> 00:13:58,665
Also, that five million.

351
00:13:58,666 --> 00:14:00,100
You took it so readily,

352
00:14:00,533 --> 00:14:02,200
so leaving me,

353
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,933
won't be too hard either.

354
00:14:08,233 --> 00:14:09,932
The classic misunderstanding is done.

355
00:14:09,933 --> 00:14:11,966
Countdown to the 'winning the wife back':

356
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,333
Seventy-two hours.

357
00:14:16,933 --> 00:14:18,933
Lin Yu'an, you stop right there.

358
00:14:22,433 --> 00:14:23,500
Lin Yu'an.

359
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,300
I order you to stop.

360
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:35,533
Lin Yu'an, I order you to stop.

361
00:14:51,133 --> 00:14:53,266
This pairing is everything.

362
00:15:11,100 --> 00:15:13,533
That's enough, music.

363
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,000
Chief Gu.

364
00:15:18,466 --> 00:15:20,733
I was just checking the audit log.

365
00:15:21,033 --> 00:15:22,033
It says here.

366
00:15:22,633 --> 00:15:23,766
Lin Yu'an's account

367
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:28,065
did indeed send out this quotation at 10:45.

368
00:15:28,066 --> 00:15:30,200
But it was from the 23rd floor meeting room.

369
00:15:30,533 --> 00:15:31,533
So?

370
00:15:31,633 --> 00:15:32,633
As far as I know,

371
00:15:32,634 --> 00:15:34,499
Lin Yu'an had left the 23rd floor

372
00:15:34,500 --> 00:15:36,132
by ten o'clock already.

373
00:15:36,133 --> 00:15:37,242
What about the surveillance?

374
00:15:37,266 --> 00:15:38,366
Surveillance.

375
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:39,960
I also wanted to ask this. Where is it?

376
00:15:40,533 --> 00:15:42,366
Last night from 8pm to 12am,

377
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,080
the main surveillance were being serviced.

378
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:45,466
Just that time?

379
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:46,166
Coincident.

380
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,900
They service surveillance every time now.

381
00:15:48,133 --> 00:15:50,533
Mr. Xu, please don't get so worked up.

382
00:15:50,933 --> 00:15:52,000
In the Short-drama world,

383
00:15:52,033 --> 00:15:54,232
surveillance equipment is pretty flexible.

384
00:15:54,233 --> 00:15:55,265
You know it perfectly well.

385
00:15:55,266 --> 00:15:56,266
I knew it.

386
00:15:56,333 --> 00:15:58,000
This could've been solved in three lines.

387
00:15:58,033 --> 00:15:59,832
And you planned to drag it out seventy-two hours?

388
00:15:59,833 --> 00:16:00,566
Warning.

389
00:16:00,833 --> 00:16:02,900
The sweet-to-angst ratio keeps dropping.

390
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:07,665
Lin Yu'an, if it wasn't you,

391
00:16:07,666 --> 00:16:09,466
why didn't you explain earlier?

392
00:16:14,733 --> 00:16:17,333
Because Xu Zhou only got half right,

393
00:16:17,533 --> 00:16:18,766
there's another half.

394
00:16:19,233 --> 00:16:22,033
I was the one who put that report in.

395
00:16:22,633 --> 00:16:23,665
Lin Yu'an.

396
00:16:23,666 --> 00:16:24,066
What?

397
00:16:24,066 --> 00:16:25,066
Let go.

398
00:16:26,700 --> 00:16:27,700
Your voice.

399
00:16:28,066 --> 00:16:29,566
I always talk like this.

400
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,200
Then what about earlier?

401
00:16:31,933 --> 00:16:34,866
Aren't you usually into gentle types?

402
00:16:34,900 --> 00:16:37,133
The female lead's aura just shifted.

403
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,865
The Chengnan project floor price leaked.

404
00:16:40,866 --> 00:16:42,566
You've been in my office.

405
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:43,999
And met the people from Shenglian.

406
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:45,400
And you took five million.

407
00:16:47,133 --> 00:16:48,133
Explain.

408
00:16:48,833 --> 00:16:49,833
Fine.

409
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:52,732
Three copies of the Chengnan project bid.

410
00:16:52,733 --> 00:16:54,666
But only the one in my hands

411
00:16:54,700 --> 00:16:55,766
is the real one.

412
00:16:56,066 --> 00:16:57,465
The other two

413
00:16:57,466 --> 00:16:59,465
were bait I planted to catch the mole.

414
00:16:59,466 --> 00:17:01,099
Shenglian got Version B.

415
00:17:01,100 --> 00:17:03,633
So the mole must be on Plan B.

416
00:17:03,666 --> 00:17:05,299
Why didn't you tell me this?

417
00:17:05,300 --> 00:17:06,500
Why would I tell you?

418
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:08,832
If I had told you, the first thing you'll do

419
00:17:08,833 --> 00:17:10,266
was call a company-wide meeting.

420
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:11,400
Would the mole wait around

421
00:17:11,433 --> 00:17:13,033
until the meeting was over to run?

422
00:17:14,233 --> 00:17:15,500
What about the five million?

423
00:17:15,666 --> 00:17:17,366
You still have the nerve to bring it up.

424
00:17:18,066 --> 00:17:19,466
I returned it long ago.

425
00:17:19,866 --> 00:17:22,366
Your mom said I'd leave if I took it.

426
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:24,099
So I came today

427
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:26,366
just to see if you'd even ask

428
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,100
why.

429
00:17:27,100 --> 00:17:27,633
I...

430
00:17:27,666 --> 00:17:28,900
But you didn't.

431
00:17:33,033 --> 00:17:34,033
Chief Gu.

432
00:17:34,733 --> 00:17:35,733
Pick it up.

433
00:17:38,266 --> 00:17:39,533
Lin Yu'an.

434
00:17:40,300 --> 00:17:41,566
You dare give me orders?

435
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:45,600
Now this is

436
00:17:47,066 --> 00:17:49,166
a domineering CEO aura minus thirty.

437
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,332
What does that mean?

438
00:17:50,333 --> 00:17:51,733
A real domineering CEO there.

439
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,880
I did nothing wrong with Chengnan project.

440
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:56,433
But this assistant role.

441
00:17:57,133 --> 00:17:58,266
I quit.

442
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:01,833
You're resigning too?

443
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:04,866
This letter was for you yesterday.

444
00:18:05,433 --> 00:18:07,265
What just happened

445
00:18:07,266 --> 00:18:08,699
just made me too tired to pretend.

446
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:09,932
Lin Yu'an,

447
00:18:09,933 --> 00:18:12,800
if you quit, are we breaking up?

448
00:18:14,333 --> 00:18:16,633
I only quit as Chief Gu's assistant,

449
00:18:16,666 --> 00:18:18,166
not as your girlfriend.

450
00:18:19,066 --> 00:18:20,866
Congratulations, Chief Gu.

451
00:18:21,933 --> 00:18:23,866
Assistant's gone, but the girlfriend stays.

452
00:18:23,900 --> 00:18:25,000
Stay out of it.

453
00:18:27,933 --> 00:18:29,166
Lin Yu'an,

454
00:18:29,933 --> 00:18:31,233
why do you have to leave?

455
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:35,700
Work is work, life is life.

456
00:18:36,233 --> 00:18:38,433
I don't want to be your assistant

457
00:18:38,733 --> 00:18:39,866
twenty-four hours a day.

458
00:18:42,466 --> 00:18:44,099
The project team travels all the time.

459
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:44,566
I know.

460
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:45,500
And the people are hard to manage.

461
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:46,033
The project manager

462
00:18:46,066 --> 00:18:47,532
has been scolded to tears by me twice.

463
00:18:47,533 --> 00:18:48,633
When did you...

464
00:18:48,666 --> 00:18:50,500
Just when you were making trouble for me.

465
00:18:52,466 --> 00:18:54,000
It's not safe for you to drive.

466
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:57,042
I haven't lost a single point on my driver's license in twelve years.

467
00:18:57,066 --> 00:18:59,666
You hit two pillars just last month.

468
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,465
That's honestly not a great argument.

469
00:19:02,466 --> 00:19:03,466
I wasn't asking you.

470
00:19:06,733 --> 00:19:08,833
Chief Gu, just sign it.

471
00:19:12,066 --> 00:19:14,532
And if I don't?

472
00:19:14,533 --> 00:19:15,566
Gu Tingshen.

473
00:19:15,600 --> 00:19:16,600
I...

474
00:19:17,733 --> 00:19:19,766
just don't want you too far from me.

475
00:19:22,333 --> 00:19:25,400
You... are you afraid I can't do it well?

476
00:19:25,800 --> 00:19:28,100
I... no,

477
00:19:28,466 --> 00:19:29,466
that's not it.

478
00:19:30,700 --> 00:19:34,100
Then... are you scared I'll do too well?

479
00:19:46,800 --> 00:19:48,199
Lin... Lin Yu'an,

480
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:49,266
stay away from me.

481
00:19:54,933 --> 00:19:56,166
But not too far.

482
00:19:58,533 --> 00:19:59,600
Actually...

483
00:20:00,066 --> 00:20:02,066
You needn't plan everything for me,

484
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:04,800
even if you do nothing at all,

485
00:20:05,533 --> 00:20:06,666
I'd still love you.

486
00:20:07,233 --> 00:20:09,433
Then... what else can I do?

487
00:20:16,533 --> 00:20:17,533
Sign this.

488
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:23,600
Okay.

489
00:20:25,333 --> 00:20:27,800
Tonight I'll pick the restaurant.

490
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:29,500
Fine.

491
00:20:29,533 --> 00:20:30,766
I'm driving myself.

492
00:20:31,433 --> 00:20:32,266
Okay.

493
00:20:32,266 --> 00:20:33,266
Don't book the entire place.

494
00:20:33,267 --> 00:20:34,865
And no buying the restaurant.

495
00:20:34,866 --> 00:20:35,976
That was an investment last time.

496
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,933
Then no investing today.

497
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:39,200
Fine.

498
00:20:40,733 --> 00:20:42,732
Core Plot Hole of the First World.

499
00:20:42,733 --> 00:20:43,766
Fixed.

500
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:46,466
What? It's done already?

501
00:20:47,466 --> 00:20:48,576
But I haven't done anything yet.

502
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:49,999
Logically speaking...

503
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,533
Mr. Xu.

504
00:20:51,833 --> 00:20:53,632
I told you from the very beginning.

505
00:20:53,633 --> 00:20:54,865
In this world,

506
00:20:54,866 --> 00:20:57,533
logic is for reference only.

507
00:21:02,800 --> 00:21:05,233
Gu Tingshen, are you leaving or not?

508
00:21:07,266 --> 00:21:08,766
Fine, let's go.

509
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:18,500
So this is the world of the rich.

510
00:21:19,933 --> 00:21:21,800
But being rich is way too exhausting.

511
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:25,466
Is this the first Fragment?

512
00:21:26,233 --> 00:21:27,100
Yes.

513
00:21:27,100 --> 00:21:28,033
Mr. Xu.

514
00:21:28,066 --> 00:21:29,299
Next, we're entering

515
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:30,566
the second world.

516
00:21:31,666 --> 00:21:33,166
Auto-Play Next Episode.

517
00:21:34,066 --> 00:21:35,500
The Second World.

518
00:21:36,233 --> 00:21:38,333
Return of the Hidden Heavyweight.

519
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:41,600
Mr. Xu, here.

520
00:21:42,533 --> 00:21:43,800
Such a handsome uniform.

521
00:21:44,233 --> 00:21:46,100
Wait, am I that heavyweight this time?

522
00:21:46,733 --> 00:21:47,366
Wait.

523
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,432
Why do I feel like there's

524
00:21:48,433 --> 00:21:49,532
some writing on the back.

525
00:21:49,533 --> 00:21:50,833
Can you take a look for me?

526
00:21:55,333 --> 00:21:56,666
What? What does it say?

527
00:21:57,100 --> 00:21:58,299
I couldn't see clearly.

528
00:21:58,300 --> 00:21:59,566
Mr. Xu.

529
00:22:00,700 --> 00:22:02,033
Next, we're entering

530
00:22:02,066 --> 00:22:03,300
the second world.

531
00:22:03,700 --> 00:22:05,033
In that second world

532
00:22:05,066 --> 00:22:07,000
the protagonist is Ye Beichen.

533
00:22:07,033 --> 00:22:08,266
I'm a security guard?

534
00:22:09,666 --> 00:22:11,400
Ye Beichen hid his name for three years.

535
00:22:11,433 --> 00:22:13,865
Tonight, he'll take nine public humiliations.

536
00:22:13,866 --> 00:22:15,000
After the nine times,

537
00:22:15,033 --> 00:22:16,832
hand over the Dragon King Token

538
00:22:16,833 --> 00:22:18,132
to trigger the identity-reveal plot

539
00:22:18,133 --> 00:22:19,633
and complete the ultimate comeback.

540
00:22:20,666 --> 00:22:22,766
But why nine times?

541
00:22:23,033 --> 00:22:24,299
Three isn't satisfying enough.

542
00:22:24,300 --> 00:22:25,699
Twelve makes people drop the drama.

543
00:22:25,700 --> 00:22:27,400
Nine. Best numbers.

544
00:22:27,933 --> 00:22:29,033
So that's how it is.

545
00:22:29,933 --> 00:22:30,766
Then look.

546
00:22:30,800 --> 00:22:32,265
What are they getting at?

547
00:22:32,266 --> 00:22:33,532
Mr. Xu.

548
00:22:33,533 --> 00:22:35,000
You've watched so many short dramas.

549
00:22:35,033 --> 00:22:36,865
Your brain's completely fried.

550
00:22:36,866 --> 00:22:38,800
This is clearly the fifth time.

551
00:22:41,333 --> 00:22:42,333
Pick it up.

552
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:45,100
That's a month's wages for you.

553
00:22:46,233 --> 00:22:47,233
Security guard!

554
00:22:49,100 --> 00:22:49,700
Here!

555
00:22:49,701 --> 00:22:50,733
Throw him out.

556
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:56,800
Get out.

557
00:22:59,133 --> 00:23:00,133
Six.

558
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,000
Wait.

559
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:07,500
Look.

560
00:23:08,266 --> 00:23:09,766
All these people down there.

561
00:23:10,233 --> 00:23:12,900
Which one can you afford to cross?

562
00:23:14,700 --> 00:23:15,700
Seven.

563
00:23:19,800 --> 00:23:20,833
Three years.

564
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,080
Look how far you've fallen.

565
00:23:27,033 --> 00:23:28,500
That's the best you can do?

566
00:23:29,133 --> 00:23:30,133
Eight.

567
00:23:30,333 --> 00:23:31,066
So that means

568
00:23:31,100 --> 00:23:33,132
on the last one, I can hand him the Dragon King Token.

569
00:23:33,133 --> 00:23:34,442
And then he makes his comeback, right?

570
00:23:34,466 --> 00:23:34,933
Right.

571
00:23:34,934 --> 00:23:36,133
Okay, no problem.

572
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,500
Chief Gu, why are you leaving?

573
00:23:39,900 --> 00:23:40,900
What now?

574
