Report!

857
00:34:47,200 --> 00:34:51,032
A dragon robe and seal were found in the deposed crown prince

858
00:34:51,033 --> 00:34:52,533
along with a treason letter.

859
00:34:55,500 --> 00:34:56,533
Eldest Prince.

860
00:34:56,833 --> 00:34:57,833
This is bad.

861
00:34:58,233 --> 00:35:00,300
These were found in your residence.

862
00:35:00,633 --> 00:35:01,900
My residence?

863
00:35:02,300 --> 00:35:04,166
Whose are these? What a size.

864
00:35:04,666 --> 00:35:08,666
Evidence weighs function, not size.

865
00:35:09,266 --> 00:35:12,299
Then why is Father's imperial seal here?

866
00:35:12,300 --> 00:35:13,800
There's also a seditious poem.

867
00:35:13,833 --> 00:35:14,833
Read it.

868
00:35:16,266 --> 00:35:18,500
Emperors take turns.

869
00:35:19,166 --> 00:35:22,400
Isn't the next line 'Next year mine'?

870
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:24,133
Indeed.

871
00:35:25,633 --> 00:35:27,265
The framing isn't even creative.

872
00:35:27,266 --> 00:35:30,333
And here's a censor's memorial too.

873
00:35:30,833 --> 00:35:32,033
It says

874
00:35:32,966 --> 00:35:36,400
Crown Prince accused of purging northern veterans

875
00:35:36,633 --> 00:35:39,733
fearing meritorious officials.

876
00:35:42,166 --> 00:35:43,766
You planted the dragon robe.

877
00:35:44,233 --> 00:35:46,500
You submitted the memorial.

878
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:57,633
You're pulling this again.

879
00:35:57,634 --> 00:35:59,232
You always pulled this as a kid when mad.

880
00:35:59,233 --> 00:36:00,166
Let go.

881
00:36:00,200 --> 00:36:01,200
Back then you'd use your height on me

882
00:36:01,200 --> 00:36:01,833
and pinned my head down

883
00:36:01,833 --> 00:36:02,633
so my fists couldn't reach you.

884
00:36:02,634 --> 00:36:03,832
You're still not taller than me.

885
00:36:03,833 --> 00:36:05,265
But now you needn't be the taller one

886
00:36:05,266 --> 00:36:06,300
to win against you.

887
00:36:11,300 --> 00:36:12,899
You planted the dragon robe, didn't you?

888
00:36:12,900 --> 00:36:13,900
I really didn't.

889
00:36:14,300 --> 00:36:15,565
The Censorate impeached me yesterday

890
00:36:15,566 --> 00:36:17,699
for suppressing my brother and fearing the meritorious.

891
00:36:17,700 --> 00:36:18,899
Didn't you pass this on?

892
00:36:18,900 --> 00:36:19,833
It wasn't me either.

893
00:36:19,866 --> 00:36:21,665
Then do you want the throne back or not?

894
00:36:21,666 --> 00:36:22,600
Only a dog would want it.

895
00:36:22,633 --> 00:36:24,100
Then why did you come back?

896
00:36:25,766 --> 00:36:27,265
Father Emperor issued three edicts.

897
00:36:27,266 --> 00:36:28,900
I turned down the first two.

898
00:36:29,266 --> 00:36:30,766
The third time, he sent the doctor

899
00:36:30,800 --> 00:36:31,933
to block the camp entrance.

900
00:36:32,200 --> 00:36:33,133
If I hadn't come back

901
00:36:33,166 --> 00:36:35,500
thirty thousand men would defy the edict.

902
00:36:36,566 --> 00:36:37,700
Eldest Prince.

903
00:36:38,266 --> 00:36:40,166
This isn't a summons for you.

904
00:36:40,466 --> 00:36:41,466
This is clearly

905
00:36:41,966 --> 00:36:43,600
a setup to take you down.

906
00:36:45,766 --> 00:36:47,233
I was Crown Prince for twelve years.

907
00:36:47,633 --> 00:36:49,533
Up at the Yin hour, down at the Zi hour.

908
00:36:49,800 --> 00:36:52,099
Reading, court, feasts, ancestor rites.

909
00:36:52,100 --> 00:36:54,000
Even sick, I had to hear Zizhi Tongjian.

910
00:36:54,466 --> 00:36:55,766
I finally got deposed.

911
00:36:55,800 --> 00:36:57,300
Why would I come back on my own?

912
00:36:58,166 --> 00:36:59,365
You guard against me like this.

913
00:36:59,366 --> 00:37:00,926
Are you reluctant to give up this seat?

914
00:37:01,266 --> 00:37:02,500
Who can't let go?

915
00:37:03,666 --> 00:37:05,500
I served as Regent for two years.

916
00:37:05,700 --> 00:37:07,299
Droughts and floods came to me.

917
00:37:07,300 --> 00:37:08,442
Even the empty treasury came to me.

918
00:37:08,466 --> 00:37:10,400
The ministries' quarrels reached me too.

919
00:37:10,966 --> 00:37:12,965
My Palace guarded, my life was logged.

920
00:37:12,966 --> 00:37:14,099
Even stepping out for some noodles

921
00:37:14,100 --> 00:37:15,342
took three days of advance notice.

922
00:37:15,366 --> 00:37:16,632
There was a salary.

923
00:37:16,633 --> 00:37:17,566
But nowhere to spend it.

924
00:37:17,600 --> 00:37:18,832
There were servants.

925
00:37:18,833 --> 00:37:20,065
But eyes were on me too.

926
00:37:20,066 --> 00:37:22,265
Exhausting, why not rest?

927
00:37:22,266 --> 00:37:23,666
Rest in the my Palace?

928
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:25,933
The memorials still keep coming.

929
00:37:27,900 --> 00:37:29,699
I'm wary of you

930
00:37:29,700 --> 00:37:32,100
not about clinging to the Crown Prince title.

931
00:37:32,666 --> 00:37:33,809
If we truly fight for the throne,

932
00:37:33,833 --> 00:37:35,633
and I'm charged with conspiracy,

933
00:37:36,300 --> 00:37:38,433
the men who followed me,

934
00:37:38,466 --> 00:37:40,000
none of them would be cleared.

935
00:37:41,833 --> 00:37:42,833
Same for me.

936
00:37:43,233 --> 00:37:44,566
If I'm charged with treason,

937
00:37:44,600 --> 00:37:46,233
the Northern people suffer first.

938
00:37:47,033 --> 00:37:49,065
So you don't want the throne.

939
00:37:49,066 --> 00:37:50,066
No, I don't.

940
00:37:50,433 --> 00:37:51,433
You don't want it either.

941
00:37:51,900 --> 00:37:52,900
Really don't.

942
00:37:53,866 --> 00:37:55,465
You were prince twelve years, brother.

943
00:37:55,466 --> 00:37:56,333
You know the process better.

944
00:37:56,366 --> 00:37:58,300
Two years as Regent, you're great at execution.

945
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:00,000
You do it.

946
00:38:01,966 --> 00:38:03,266
His Majesty says.

947
00:38:03,766 --> 00:38:05,299
The Northern Territory is flooding.

948
00:38:05,300 --> 00:38:07,833
Which of you will lead the relief?

949
00:38:07,866 --> 00:38:08,733
Xiao Che.

950
00:38:08,766 --> 00:38:09,865
He was Regent for two years.

951
00:38:09,866 --> 00:38:11,366
He knows the Revenue books well.

952
00:38:11,400 --> 00:38:12,233
Brother.

953
00:38:12,234 --> 00:38:14,965
He managed the Northern army rations and famine himself.

954
00:38:14,966 --> 00:38:15,766
His Majesty says

955
00:38:15,767 --> 00:38:18,599
It pleases me that brothers name the worthy.

956
00:38:18,600 --> 00:38:19,799
The deposed prince leads it.

957
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:21,199
The Crown Prince will assist.

958
00:38:21,200 --> 00:38:23,500
Both will share the credit.

959
00:38:24,300 --> 00:38:25,580
This show of modesty is useless.

960
00:38:25,966 --> 00:38:28,233
Let Father think we're both no good.

961
00:38:28,666 --> 00:38:31,133
Crown Prince, please look.

962
00:38:31,166 --> 00:38:32,599
This batch of relief grain,

963
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:33,900
how should we allocate it?

964
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:39,032
I can't quite grasp these memorials.

965
00:38:39,033 --> 00:38:40,033
Don't give me that.

966
00:38:40,034 --> 00:38:41,832
You're the one who found out those bad

967
00:38:41,833 --> 00:38:43,265
Revenue books from three years.

968
00:38:43,266 --> 00:38:44,299
His Majesty says,

969
00:38:44,300 --> 00:38:46,899
The crown prince plays weak to test his brother.

970
00:38:46,900 --> 00:38:48,400
He's good at using people.

971
00:38:50,800 --> 00:38:52,040
Eldest Prince, what do you say?

972
00:38:54,400 --> 00:38:56,699
I believe the three stricken prefectures

973
00:38:56,700 --> 00:38:58,180
should raise taxes by thirty percent.

974
00:38:58,766 --> 00:39:01,465
Brother, you clearly cut taxes thirty percent.

975
00:39:01,466 --> 00:39:03,166
Why call it a tax hike?

976
00:39:03,466 --> 00:39:06,299
Sire says he pities the common folk.

977
00:39:06,300 --> 00:39:09,299
The Crown Prince corrected it at once.

978
00:39:09,300 --> 00:39:10,233
I have a bad temper.

979
00:39:10,266 --> 00:39:12,099
I've crossed half the Censorate.

980
00:39:12,100 --> 00:39:13,200
Undaunted by the censors.

981
00:39:13,233 --> 00:39:15,465
I'm frail, riding an hour makes me sick.

982
00:39:15,466 --> 00:39:17,200
No reckless bravery.

983
00:39:17,233 --> 00:39:19,299
12 years as Crown Prince, still deposed.

984
00:39:19,300 --> 00:39:21,166
Deposed, yet back by military merit.

985
00:39:21,200 --> 00:39:22,100
That's even rarer.

986
00:39:22,101 --> 00:39:23,381
I grind my teeth while sleeping.

987
00:39:24,866 --> 00:39:26,200
I can't defend this right now.

988
00:39:26,233 --> 00:39:27,233
Put it on the record.

989
00:39:32,500 --> 00:39:37,933
The Emperor has passed.

990
00:39:39,266 --> 00:39:40,300
Father.

991
00:39:41,466 --> 00:39:42,933
This is the final round:

992
00:39:42,966 --> 00:39:44,432
The edict decides the heir.

993
00:39:44,433 --> 00:39:46,966
Whoever holds it becomes the sole heir.

994
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:49,466
The other is declared the loser.

995
00:39:50,466 --> 00:39:52,566
The Emperor's edict:

996
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:56,399
Today one of you two receives this edict.

997
00:39:56,400 --> 00:39:59,500
The other will be put to death at once.

998
00:40:09,366 --> 00:40:10,686
The Crown Prince takes the edict.

999
00:40:10,900 --> 00:40:11,976
Brother, elders come first.

1000
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:13,032
I've been deposed before.

1001
00:40:13,033 --> 00:40:14,366
But you still made it back.

1002
00:40:23,066 --> 00:40:24,733
Fine.

1003
00:40:24,766 --> 00:40:26,265
I concede.

1004
00:40:26,266 --> 00:40:28,100
The loser's ending is set.

1005
00:40:29,033 --> 00:40:30,533
Crown Prince, that won't do.

1006
00:40:30,833 --> 00:40:31,700
What are you doing?

1007
00:40:31,701 --> 00:40:33,299
Here, you're not losing people,

1008
00:40:33,300 --> 00:40:34,300
you're losing lives.

1009
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:35,333
What do you mean?

1010
00:40:35,366 --> 00:40:35,966
The two of you,

1011
00:40:35,967 --> 00:40:37,365
if one of you wins,

1012
00:40:37,366 --> 00:40:39,833
the other dies on the spot.

1013
00:40:40,433 --> 00:40:41,433
Still fighting over it?

1014
00:40:42,900 --> 00:40:43,900
Yes, I will.

1015
00:40:46,900 --> 00:40:48,366
But not against you.

1016
00:40:55,766 --> 00:40:58,032
Core items can't be destroyed.

1017
00:40:58,033 --> 00:40:59,499
The deposed Crown Prince returns.

1018
00:40:59,500 --> 00:41:01,433
He'll threaten the Crown Prince's seat.

1019
00:41:01,866 --> 00:41:02,766
Eldest Prince.

1020
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:04,733
He said after you went north,

1021
00:41:05,666 --> 00:41:07,400
you'd threaten the Crown Prince's seat.

1022
00:41:07,433 --> 00:41:08,633
Who says that?

1023
00:41:09,433 --> 00:41:10,566
This world.

1024
00:41:10,600 --> 00:41:11,733
Then it must be a mistake.

1025
00:41:12,266 --> 00:41:13,333
I won't fight for it.

1026
00:41:14,866 --> 00:41:16,066
I won't be wary of you either.

1027
00:41:16,200 --> 00:41:18,133
Succession rivalry can't be established.

1028
00:41:18,166 --> 00:41:20,065
Unable to generate the loser verdict.

1029
00:41:20,066 --> 00:41:21,200
Rule conflict.

1030
00:41:25,300 --> 00:41:26,300
Brother.

1031
00:41:26,500 --> 00:41:27,633
Are you going back north?

1032
00:41:28,100 --> 00:41:28,733
I am.

1033
00:41:29,066 --> 00:41:30,066
Take me with you.

1034
00:41:30,500 --> 00:41:31,566
You're the Crown Prince.

1035
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:32,800
That's why I want to go back.

1036
00:41:33,600 --> 00:41:34,600
Dream on.

1037
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:35,933
Again?

1038
00:41:35,966 --> 00:41:38,099
You always pulled this as a kid when mad.

1039
00:41:38,100 --> 00:41:39,433
The snacks prepared for you.

1040
00:41:39,466 --> 00:41:40,499
Hurry up and eat.

1041
00:41:40,500 --> 00:41:41,566
I won't eat it.

1042
00:41:42,966 --> 00:41:44,200
The third world.

1043
00:41:45,033 --> 00:41:46,266
The third fragment.

1044
00:41:47,066 --> 00:41:48,066
Mr. Xu.

1045
00:41:48,266 --> 00:41:49,533
In the third world,

1046
00:41:49,566 --> 00:41:51,199
the core glitch is fixed too.

1047
00:41:51,200 --> 00:41:52,200
Congratulations.

1048
00:41:52,466 --> 00:41:53,600
Everything is done.

1049
00:41:53,900 --> 00:41:54,900
This time,

1050
00:41:55,366 --> 00:41:57,665
it's all thanks to those two brothers' own choices.

1051
00:41:57,666 --> 00:41:59,400
The short drama world is fun.

1052
00:41:59,800 --> 00:42:00,800
So,

1053
00:42:01,400 --> 00:42:02,633
can I go back now?

1054
00:42:09,633 --> 00:42:11,100
The three worlds,

1055
00:42:13,266 --> 00:42:14,500
three lives,

1056
00:42:16,100 --> 00:42:17,166
the three fragments.

1057
00:42:19,066 --> 00:42:20,346
I've finally collected them all.

1058
00:42:21,866 --> 00:42:23,733
I guess I'm pretty impressive.

1059
00:42:25,433 --> 00:42:26,533
Now,

1060
00:42:27,033 --> 00:42:28,900
seeing 'Return to Reality'

1061
00:42:29,366 --> 00:42:31,166
feels better than my paycheck.

1062
00:42:32,566 --> 00:42:33,633
I'm going back now.

1063
00:42:35,866 --> 00:42:36,866
Wait a moment.

1064
00:42:39,466 --> 00:42:40,466
What is it?

1065
00:42:40,666 --> 00:42:42,499
You rushed me harder than anyone,

1066
00:42:42,500 --> 00:42:44,299
and now you can't bear to let me go?

1067
00:42:44,300 --> 00:42:45,333
Mr. Xu,

1068
00:42:45,900 --> 00:42:46,900
please come here.

1069
00:42:47,433 --> 00:42:49,233
I just wanted to remind you,

1070
00:42:49,500 --> 00:42:51,033
a qualified experiencer

1071
00:42:51,066 --> 00:42:52,306
is entitled to a hidden reward.

1072
00:42:52,766 --> 00:42:53,766
What hidden reward?

1073
00:42:53,767 --> 00:42:55,300
A hundred-billion fortune,

1074
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:57,699
the protagonist halo,

1075
00:42:57,700 --> 00:42:59,533
a safety net for key plot beats.

1076
00:42:59,566 --> 00:43:00,599
And most of all,

1077
00:43:00,600 --> 00:43:02,133
you can also choose

1078
00:43:02,166 --> 00:43:03,500
your next life experience.

1079
00:43:03,766 --> 00:43:05,199
Can I stay here

1080
00:43:05,200 --> 00:43:06,899
and live the protagonist's life?

1081
00:43:06,900 --> 00:43:09,033
Yes, premium members get other perks.

1082
00:43:09,066 --> 00:43:09,900
Key misunderstanding,

1083
00:43:09,901 --> 00:43:11,099
can be cleared with one click.

1084
00:43:11,100 --> 00:43:12,765
The villain's comeuppance

1085
00:43:12,766 --> 00:43:14,565
must land within three minutes.

1086
00:43:14,566 --> 00:43:16,000
Important character death

1087
00:43:16,400 --> 00:43:17,933
can request revival.

1088
00:43:18,100 --> 00:43:20,000
But why in the first world

1089
00:43:20,033 --> 00:43:21,733
did I struggle over one misunderstanding?

1090
00:43:21,766 --> 00:43:24,099
Back then, you weren't a VIP protagonist.

1091
00:43:24,100 --> 00:43:25,100
Your service tiers

1092
00:43:25,101 --> 00:43:26,233
are pretty detailed.

1093
00:43:26,400 --> 00:43:27,865
What about regular users?

1094
00:43:27,866 --> 00:43:30,666
They sort it out and bear the cost.

1095
00:43:30,866 --> 00:43:32,465
You're way too realistic.

1096
00:43:32,466 --> 00:43:33,466
Mr. Xu.

1097
00:43:34,066 --> 00:43:35,066
Come over here.

1098
00:43:35,433 --> 00:43:36,666
Think it over carefully.

1099
00:43:37,066 --> 00:43:39,200
Suppose you go back to the real world.

1100
00:43:39,233 --> 00:43:41,232
You won't be blessed by the protagonist identity.

1101
00:43:41,233 --> 00:43:42,366
I won't have the blessings?

1102
00:43:42,400 --> 00:43:44,699
The people you lost won't return.

1103
00:43:44,700 --> 00:43:45,533
The mistakes you made

1104
00:43:45,566 --> 00:43:47,199
you'll never get to fix.

1105
00:43:47,200 --> 00:43:48,465
But if you stay here,

1106
00:43:48,466 --> 00:43:49,899
every mistake you make

1107
00:43:49,900 --> 00:43:50,800
will be written as

1108
00:43:50,833 --> 00:43:52,733
an epic, meaningful one.

1109
00:43:54,633 --> 00:43:55,633
Wait a second.

1110
00:43:55,866 --> 00:43:56,500
Why do I feel like

1111
00:43:56,501 --> 00:43:58,699
your sales pitch today is so pushy?

1112
00:43:58,700 --> 00:44:00,233
I'm just offering a better option.

1113
00:44:00,266 --> 00:44:02,266
Are you scared I'll return?

1114
00:44:02,833 --> 00:44:03,966
Still,

1115
00:44:04,800 --> 00:44:06,266
you've got a point.

1116
00:44:07,466 --> 00:44:09,465
So if I stay in this world

1117
00:44:09,466 --> 00:44:10,733
and live the protagonist's life

1118
00:44:10,766 --> 00:44:13,366
is there anything I should know upfront?

1119
00:44:13,400 --> 00:44:15,033
This way, Mr. Xu.

1120
00:44:15,966 --> 00:44:17,699
The standard deal is pretty long.

1121
00:44:17,700 --> 00:44:18,100
This long?

1122
00:44:18,100 --> 00:44:19,100
Take your time reading.

1123
00:44:20,766 --> 00:44:21,866
What does this mean?

1124
00:44:22,166 --> 00:44:25,433
Player No. 158.

1125
00:44:26,066 --> 00:44:28,466
158 isn't your employee ID.

1126
00:44:29,033 --> 00:44:31,066
You're an experiencer too.

1127
00:44:32,300 --> 00:44:34,699
So you recognized me after all.

1128
00:44:34,700 --> 00:44:36,766
You went through the three worlds too.

1129
00:44:37,466 --> 00:44:38,366
Not a single stage missed.

1130
00:44:38,400 --> 00:44:39,033
You...

1131
00:44:39,034 --> 00:44:41,166
The system gave me two options.

1132
00:44:41,500 --> 00:44:43,000
I thought real life was too plain.

1133
00:44:43,033 --> 00:44:44,700
So I chose the protagonist's life.

1134
00:44:45,166 --> 00:44:46,699
